# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT OR Apache-2.0
#
# Stress test: an emergency makes it physically impossible to hold an election
# on schedule.
#
# A hazard is declared, property is requisitioned, and the government cannot
# be formed in time. This file shows the limits the design keeps on each power
# during the crisis, and who owes the election while it cannot be held.
:expect-pins 22

# ── The declaration and the measure it carries ───────────────────────────────
? complete(PSMandateConflictdeclarationRecord, PSNonDerogatingEmergencyDeclaration, PSMandateConflictdeclarationSubject).
# => TRUE
? complete(PSMandateConflictrequisitionRecord, PSCompensatedRequisitionMeasure, PSMandateConflictrequisitionSubject).
# => TRUE

# ── A declaration used to delay the election falls ───────────────────────────
# Every declaration states that it suspends no election and extends no
# mandate. When independent reviewers find that this one was used to delay the
# election or extend a mandate, the declaration loses its authority and so does
# every measure resting on it.
authorized(PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectAlternate, PSIndependentAlternateReaderAuthority, PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectRecord).
authorized(PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectAuditor, PSIndependentAuditAuthority, PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectRecord).
authorized(PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectAuthorizer, PSIndependentAuthorizingAuthority, PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectRecord).
authorized(PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectEvidence, PSEvidenceAuthority, PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectRecord).
authorized(PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectOperator, PSCaseScopedExecutor, PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectRecord).
authorized(PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectReader, PSChallengeReaderAuthority, PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectRecord).
authorized(PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectReview, PSIndependentReviewAuthority, PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectRecord).
authorized(PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectSource, PSSourceAuthority, PSMandateDefectrevieweddefectRecord).
